The .353 roadmap (planner-generated) already assigned exp3837 to
'learned-contribution-characterization' (exp3834-3843 span), which is running now.
My .354 staging had reused 3837 for the verifier-moat scissor-at-scale task — a
number collision (duplicate run script / result-artifact id / capstone-aggregation
ambiguity). Renumbered the .354 scissor task to exp3844 (next free id). exp3833
(LDT-gap) untouched; the .353 exp3837 is unaffected.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
